# battery_emergency_takeoff_airborne.expect — the EMERGENCY in the air in TAKEOFF lands the craft; it touches down gently and the motors stop on the floor
# TAKEOFF の空中の EMERGENCY は機体を着陸させる。静かに接地し、モータは床の上で止まる
#
exit 0
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Battery emergency → LANDING"
log_contains any "Transition: TAKEOFF → LANDING"
log_contains any "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
log_absent any "without evidence of the air"
log_absent any "Transition: TAKEOFF → IDLE_GROUND"
log_absent any "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Battery emergency → LANDING"
order "Battery emergency → LANDING" "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
metric alt_max < 0.6 in 7.0 22.0
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 20.0 22.0
metric duty_max < 0.01 in 20.0 22.0
metric descent_speed_max < 0.7 in 8.2 22.0
